      "understanding": {
        "goal_understanding": "Navigate the grid to reach and step onto each goal cell after making sure the carried piece exactly matches that goal\u2019s required shape, color, and rotation. Activating and completing all goals in the level advances to the next level; completing all levels wins. Avoid running out of stamina/lives.",
        "mechanics_understanding": "Each move (N/S/E/W) attempts to move one tile; walls can block movement. The carried piece has three attributes: shape, color, and rotation (0/90/180/270). Stepping on modifier tiles changes one attribute: shape modifiers cycle the shape, color modifiers cycle the color, and rotation modifiers rotate the piece 90\u00b0 clockwise. A goal becomes activated only when all three attributes match its requirements simultaneously; then stepping onto the goal cell completes it. Stamina decreases with actions, and hitting zero stamina costs a life; losing all lives ends the game."
